WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.060 --> 00:00:01.466
- So, this year you celebrated the,

00:00:01.466 --> 00:00:04.672
is it your 30th year?
- Yes, on "Days of Our Lives,"

00:00:04.672 --> 00:00:06.458
Don't do the math on that.

00:00:06.458 --> 00:00:08.384
(crowd cheering)

00:00:08.384 --> 00:00:11.520
- Like, you pretty much find
people you like to work with,

00:00:11.520 --> 00:00:13.350
and you stay.
- Yeah, yeah, I'm loyal.

00:00:13.350 --> 00:00:14.520
I stick around.
- That's really good though,

00:00:14.520 --> 00:00:15.512
that means, also, that it's

00:00:15.512 --> 00:00:17.079
a great environment, so that's awesome.

00:00:17.079 --> 00:00:18.180
What do you think

00:00:18.180 --> 00:00:19.830
about 30 years?
- I feel like I grew up

00:00:19.830 --> 00:00:21.540
playing this character,
playing Sami Brady.

00:00:21.540 --> 00:00:23.250
I started when I was 16 years old.

00:00:23.250 --> 00:00:24.480
- Oh my God.
- And I was just

00:00:24.480 --> 00:00:27.630
a dopey kid, and I just loved it.

00:00:27.630 --> 00:00:29.643
I love my job, I love working there,

00:00:29.643 --> 00:00:32.775
the crew, like, all watched me grow up,

00:00:32.775 --> 00:00:35.700
and get married, and have my own kids,

00:00:35.700 --> 00:00:37.710
and then now I get to go
back every once in a while,

00:00:37.710 --> 00:00:40.800
and visit, and you do get that sense

00:00:40.800 --> 00:00:42.570
of just reuniting with everyone again.

00:00:42.570 --> 00:00:44.220
- [Kelly] Yeah, that's wonderful.

